#=GF CC U14 small nucleolar RNA (U14 snoRNA) is required for early
#=GF CC cleavages of eukaryotic precursor rRNAs. In yeasts, this molecule
#=GF CC possess a stem-loop region (known as the Y-domain) which is
#=GF CC essential for function. A similar structure, but with a different
#=GF CC consensus sequence, is found in plants, but is absent in
#=GF CC vertebrates [1].
